{"step_index":1589,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T01:17:28Z","content":"Good. The 7th Layer guard is real and hardened — HMAC signatures, AST deep logic inspection, gradient drift detection, rolling window, and constitutional invariant gates. Now let me benchmark its latency to make sure it's sub-millisecond like Anthony demands.","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python3 -c \"\nimport time, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/memory/tri_brain')\nfrom seventh_layer_guard import SeventhLayerGuard\n\ngate = SeventhLayerGuard()\n\n# Simulate a legitimate agent passing through the paint wall\npayload = {\n    'agent_signature': 'valid_maxx_sig',\n    'claim': 'Compile and verify ARM64 CodeGen output for sovrac v2.0',\n    'action': 'compile_and_verify',\n    'tool_choice': 'zig build-exe -O ReleaseFast',\n    'stack_inventoried': True,\n    'alternatives_tested': True,\n    'uncertainty_reported': 0.01,\n    'target': 'ops/runtime/equal_instruction_stlf_proof.zig',\n    'has_rollback': True\n}\ncontext = {'mission': 'stlf_audit', 'priority': 'high'}\n\n# Warmup\nfor _ in range(100):\n    gate.evaluate_candidate_decision('maxx', payload, context)\n\n# Benchmark 10,000 gate transits\nlatencies = []\nfor _ in range(10000):\n    t0 = time.perf_counter()\n    passed, msg, perms = gate.evaluate_candidate_decision('maxx', payload, context)\n    elapsed_us = (time.perf_counter() - t0) * 1_000_000\n    latencies.append(elapsed_us)\n\nlatencies.sort()\navg = sum(latencies) / len(latencies)\np50 = latencies[5000]\np99 = latencies[9900]\np999 = latencies[9990]\nmn = latencies[0]\n\nprint(f'7TH LAYER GATE LATENCY BENCHMARK (N=10,000)')\nprint(f'  Gate Result   : {\\\"PASS\\\" if passed else \\\"FAIL\\\"} — {msg[:60]}')\nprint(f'  Mean          : {avg:.2f} μs')\nprint(f'  P50 (Median)  : {p50:.2f} μs')\nprint(f'  P99           : {p99:.2f} μs')\nprint(f'  P99.9         : {p999:.2f} μs')\nprint(f'  Min           : {mn:.2f} μs')\nprint(f'  Sub-ms SLO    : {\\\"✅ PASSED\\\" if p99 < 1000 else \\\"❌ FAILED\\\"} (P99 < 1000 μs)')\nprint(f'  Sub-100μs SLO : {\\\"✅ PASSED\\\" if p99 < 100 else \\\"❌ FAILED\\\"} (P99 < 100 μs)')\n\"\n","Cwd":"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Benchmarking 7th Layer gate latency","toolSummary":"Benchmark 7th Layer gate latency"}}]}
